      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "第八章提要"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "物体的动量是描写运动的一个重要物理量. 动量是矢",
        "量，它等于物体的质量和它的速度的乘积."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在一定时间 $t$ 内作用的同一个力 $\\vec{F}$，使所有物体都产生",
        "相同的动量，它等于力的冲量 $\\vec{F}t$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "对于动量，守恒定律是成立的."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**在孤立系统内，当物体任意相互作用和任意运动时，该系",
        "统内物体的总动量保持不变.**"
      ]
    },
